<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">TEMPLE OF SETHRALISS · MYTHIC+ · RETRIBUTION PALADIN</div>
    <h1><span class="cls">惩戒骑</span><span class="dot">·</span>塞塔里斯神庙 应对手册</h1>
    <p class="lede">这本的压力集中在三处：毒蛇道三叶虫的流血冲锋、加瓦兹特的尖塔光束、化身战的腐化。圣佑约一分钟转好就交；圣盾 3.5 分钟，必留给光束和腐化，中间隔够冷却才顺手用；保护祝福给自己清三叶虫流血；化身战在化身能吃治疗时把圣疗术交给它。</p>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip">参考 <b>+23 限时惩戒（国 / 欧 / 美）</b></span>
      <span class="chip">英雄天赋 <b>烈日先驱</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="nav" aria-label="阶段导航">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nav-scroll">
      <a href="#prep" class="on">速记</a>
      <a href="#timeline">时间轴</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#s1">开场</a>
      <a href="#s2"><span class="n">①</span>双子</a>
      <a href="#s3">毒蛇道</a>
      <a href="#s4"><span class="n">②</span>米利克萨</a>
      <a href="#s5">风暴云</a>
      <a href="#s6"><span class="n">③</span>加瓦兹特</a>
      <a href="#s7">前厅</a>
      <a href="#s8"><span class="n">④</span>化身</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#talent">天赋</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="wrap">

<section id="prep">
  <h2><span class="k">00</span>开打前速记</h2>
  <p class="sub">四张手牌管住全本，外加一条自律规则和三个必断读条。</p>

  <div class="cores">
    <article class="core main">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:642}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">圣盾术</div><div class="cd">3.5 分钟 · 持续 8 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>免疫一切伤害，清掉多数有害效果（腐化清不掉）。必留给加瓦兹特光束和化身腐化；其余地方只在距下个必留点不少于 3.5 分钟时顺手交。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:403876}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">圣佑术</div><div class="cd">约 1 分钟 · 持续 8 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>减伤三成并附带复仇之盾。全本主力减伤，转好就交给下一个全团读条或身上的持续伤害。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1022}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">保护祝福</div><div class="cd">5 分钟 · 持续 10 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>免疫物理并清掉流血。主要给自己清三叶虫的锯齿冲锋；暗影、自然伤害挡不住。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:6940}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">牺牲祝福</div><div class="cd">1 分钟 · 持续 12 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>替队友分担三成伤害；点了正义保护还会清掉并挡住对方的中毒。开着圣盾时转来的伤害全免，正好转好就趁圣盾给出去。</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="limit">
    <div class="h">自律只锁保护和圣疗</div>
    圣盾、保护祝福、圣疗术都会给目标挂 30 秒<b>自律</b>。点了圣光决断，<b>自律期间照样能开圣盾</b>；但自己挂着自律时<b>不能给自己保护祝福或圣疗术</b>，先交保护清流血、再按需开圣盾。圣疗术交给化身时，自律挂在化身身上，不影响你。
  </div>

  <div class="kicks-box">
    <div class="kicks-head">
      <img class="ic" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="责难">
      <h3>全本必断读条</h3>
      <span>点击跳到对应战斗</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kicks">
      <a class="kick" href="#k-bolt">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">01</span><span>风暴能手 / 灌注能量的唤雷者 · 开场、风暴云</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">闪电箭</div>
        <div class="why">单体重击接近八十万自然伤害，两种施法者都要断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-venom">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">02</span><span>育巢者 · 毒蛇道</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">毒箭</div>
        <div class="why">读条频率高，固定盯一只育巢者轮着断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-spit">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">03</span><span>剧毒蝰蛇 · 米利克萨</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">毒素喷吐</div>
        <div class="why">首领战里刷出的蝰蛇读条，漏了给队友挂 8 秒毒。</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="timeline">
  <h2><span class="k">01</span>一场里圣盾和保护交在哪</h2>
  <p class="sub">一场 +23 限时实录（展示真实冷却节奏，非每波强制照搬；具体取舍见下方路线）。</p>
  <div class="tl-card">
    <div class="tl-scroll">
{{TIMELINE}}
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <span><i class="pri"></i>必留圣盾点</span>
      <span><i class="e"></i>保护祝福 · 清流血</span>
      <span><i class="v"></i>圣疗术 · 给化身</span>
      <span><i class="muted"></i>顺手圣盾</span>
      <span><i class="boss"></i>首领战</span>
      <span><i class="trash"></i>小怪段</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="route">
  <h2><span class="k">02</span>按路线逐段</h2>
  <p class="sub">看到什么 → 按什么 → 为什么。带「必做」标签的高亮行是每把必做的关键动作。</p>

  <div class="route">

    <!-- 开场 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s1">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>开场 → 双子</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 沙怒石拳战士 / 风暴能手 / 流沙猎手 / 隐秘之牙</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>圣佑转好就交给震地；圣盾和保护留到双子和毒蛇道。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:265966}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">震地</div><div class="s">沙怒石拳战士读条 · 60 码全团物理 + 击退</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条时开，这一下是开场最疼的全团伤害。圣佑在冷却时，给自己保护祝福也能免疫（兜底；保护 5 分钟才转好，距计划清流血的那波不足 5 分钟就别交）。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-bolt">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1291262}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">闪电箭</div><div class="s">风暴能手读条 · 单体自然重击</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="">责难</span></div>
            <div class="why">风暴能手从开场一直跟到毒蛇道，每次读条都断；后面风暴云的唤雷者同名读条同样断。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1308116}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">箭雨</div><div class="s">流沙猎手 · 点名 9 秒物理引导</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:115750}}" alt="">盲目之光</span><span class="or">或</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:853}}" alt="">制裁之锤</span></div>
            <div class="why">瞬发引导，责难断不掉，也没有落点可躲；<b>控住流沙猎手就停引导</b>，打满 9 秒能掉大半管血。控制都在冷却时，被点的人给自己保护祝福可以免疫（兜底）。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">建议：圣佑交震地，大招全留</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s2">下一段：双子 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 1 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s2">
      <div class="node">1</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>阿德里斯与阿斯匹克斯</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 1</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>圣佑转好就交给阵风。圣盾离加瓦兹特开打远超 3.5 分钟，可以顺手交给一次电闪雷鸣；不交也行。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1288457}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">阵风</div><div class="s">阿斯匹克斯点名 · 4 秒自然持续</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">整场反复点名，圣佑一转好就交给它，每跳少三成。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1288092}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">电闪雷鸣</div><div class="s">4.5 秒读条 · 冲刺 8 码分摊 → 约 5 秒后 20 码惊雷</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span></div>
            <div class="why">常规：<b>先站进 8 码接冲刺分摊</b>，冲刺落地后 5 秒内退出 20 码躲惊雷。要用圣盾就<b>读条最后 1–2 秒开</b>，8 秒刚好盖住分摊和惊雷；开早了惊雷前圣盾会掉，照样要退。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1311808}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">暴风</div><div class="s">落点 8 码 · 留下 2 分钟风区</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">点名时把落点带到场边</span></div>
            <div class="why">站进风区会被沉默缴械 4 秒，近战位被占满就打不了输出。狂风之力会把全团击退，背对风区站，别被吹进去。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1291399}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">锯齿冲锋</div><div class="s">倒刺三叶虫（随首领一起拉进来的小怪）· 物理 + 6 秒流血</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1022}}" alt="">保护祝福</span></div>
            <div class="why">备选：同毒蛇道，被冲锋连续盯上时可以在这里交保护。保护 5 分钟才转好，交了以后毒蛇道前半段的流血改交圣佑或圣盾。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">建议：圣盾 0–1 次（交电闪雷鸣）</span><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑转好就交阵风</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s3">下一段：毒蛇道 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 毒蛇道 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s3">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>毒蛇道 → 米利克萨</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 砂誓骑兵（三叶虫群） / 剧毒蝰蛇 / 育巢者 / 闪电毒蛇</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm warn"><span class="lbl">高压段</span>三叶虫群的流血冲锋叠在剧毒蝰蛇的毒上。保护祝福交给流血叠得最高的那一波；圣盾只在距加瓦兹特开打不少于 3.5 分钟时顺手清流血或毒（这段一般都满足），否则留着。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1291399}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>锯齿冲锋</div><div class="s">三叶虫群冲锋 · 物理 + 6 秒流血</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1022}}" alt="">保护祝福</span><span class="tgt">给自己</span></div>
            <div class="why">身上流血叠高、保护又转好时开：<b>流血当场清掉</b>，之后 10 秒的冲锋全部免疫。保护没转好先交圣佑。保护后自己挂 30 秒自律，这期间要救急只能开圣盾。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1291399}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">锯齿冲锋</div><div class="s">保护已用</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span><span class="or">或</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span></div>
            <div class="why">先交圣佑；圣佑也在冷却、离加瓦兹特又够远，就开圣盾清掉流血和身上的毒（自律期间照样能开）。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1308148}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">细胞毒素</div><div class="s">剧毒蝰蛇 · 中毒 · 10 秒自然持续</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:213644}}" alt="">清毒术</span></div>
            <div class="why">清毒术 8 秒冷却，自己和队友身上见到就清。备选：牺牲祝福（正义保护）给中毒队友，上身瞬间也会清掉这层毒，并在 12 秒里挡住新毒。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-venom">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1310683}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒箭</div><div class="s">育巢者读条 · 单体自然</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="">责难</span><span class="or">或</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:115750}}" alt="">盲目之光</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条间隔短，固定盯一只轮着断；责难在冷却时可用盲目之光控住（备选）。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">锯齿冲锋流血每跳吃多少（含吸收）</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">25.6 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>圣佑术</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:72%">18.4 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1022}}" alt="">建议：保护 1 次清流血</span><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾 0–1 次（距加瓦兹特 ≥ 3.5 分钟才交）</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s4">下一段：米利克萨 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 2 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s4">
      <div class="node">2</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>米利克萨</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 2</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>这场不留大招位置，圣佑转好就交给雷霆喷吐点名。圣盾已经转好、且距加瓦兹特开打还有 3.5 分钟以上，才可以在这里救急。首领钻地时全团持续掉血，靠治疗。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1298329}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">雷霆喷吐</div><div class="s">点名 · 4 秒内每秒雷击落脚处 · 留萦绕风暴</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">被点名时开圣佑，同时一直走位：雷击打的是你站的位置，停下来就连吃。萦绕风暴别带进近战位。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-spit">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:267027}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒素喷吐</div><div class="s">剧毒蝰蛇读条 · 8 秒自然持续</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="">责难</span></div>
            <div class="why">首领战里刷出的蝰蛇，每次读条都断；漏了就用清毒术清掉。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1290030}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">缠绕蛇群</div><div class="s">蛇群缠住队友 · 昏迷并持续掉血</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">转火蛇群，把队友打出来</span></div>
            <div class="why">打蛇群或控住蛇群才能解救，被缠的人自己动不了。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:264206}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">钻地</div><div class="s">米利克萨钻入地下 · 路径击飞并昏迷 4 秒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">看地面路径，提前横移让开</span></div>
            <div class="why">被撞到要晕 4 秒；钻地期间的钻地之震全团每秒一跳，圣佑没交给喷吐时可以交这里（备选）。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1293048}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒蛇风暴</div><div class="s">全团击退 · 8 秒自然持续</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">被击退后避开场上的风暴打击</span></div>
            <div class="why">持续伤害靠治疗，圣佑已经交给喷吐就别再找它。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">建议：圣佑交雷霆喷吐 · 圣盾不交</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s5">下一段：风暴云 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 风暴云 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s5">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>风暴云 → 加瓦兹特</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 暴怒云气 / 灌注能量的唤雷者 / 静电异常体</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>圣佑转好就交给下一次释放电荷；几只云气的读条比圣佑冷却密，没转好的那几次靠治疗。圣盾留给加瓦兹特，这段不交。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1293475}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>释放电荷</div><div class="s">暴怒云气积攒电荷后读条 · 全团自然</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条时开，全团每人都吃一下，不开约八十万。圣佑没转好就提前站好位，等治疗抬血。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1291262}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">闪电箭</div><div class="s">灌注能量的唤雷者读条</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="">责难</span></div>
            <div class="why">同开场，这段的第一打断目标。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1296052}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">灌能传导</div><div class="s">唤雷者 · 魔法 · 20 秒持续，结束时昏迷</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">喊治疗驱散</span></div>
            <div class="why">魔法效果，清毒术清不掉；拖到结束会被打晕。备选：责难断掉唤雷者，传导也会跟着结束。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:264763}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">火花步</div><div class="s">静电异常体闪到玩家身边 · 5 码</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">近战位别叠成一团</span></div>
            <div class="why">5 码内的人一起吃，散开就只打一个人。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">释放电荷每下吃多少（含吸收；圣佑自带复仇之盾）</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">81.6 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>圣佑术</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:72%">58.7 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">建议：圣佑转好就交放电 · 圣盾不交</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s6">下一段：加瓦兹特 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 3 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s6">
      <div class="node">3</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>加瓦兹特</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 3</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>近战要轮流站进闪电尖塔的光束，挡住首领充能；充满就放电，全团吃伤害并降低输出。圣盾必留在这里：站进光束后开，8 秒内免伤继续挡；其余几轮交圣佑。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:266923}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>镀流（挡光束）</div><div class="s">每 0.5 秒自然 · 受到物理伤害 +250%</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span></div>
            <div class="why"><b>站进光束、镀流上身后再开圣盾</b>：圣盾里镀流照样刷新，光束照样挡住，8 秒伤害全免。离开光束前确认有队友接上。牺牲祝福正好转好，可以趁圣盾给队友，转来的伤害同样全免。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:266923}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">镀流（挡光束）</div><div class="s">圣盾在冷却</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">进光束就开，每跳能少三成；圣佑也没好就少站几跳，换队友接。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1290531}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">诱导</div><div class="s">全团电能脉冲 · 留下 1 分钟诱导力场</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">脉冲后马上走出力场</span></div>
            <div class="why">脉冲约每 23 秒固定来一次，和挡光束无关；力场每秒都会电你，出了圈别回去。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">挡光束时镀流每跳吃多少（开圣盾则为 0）</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">15.3 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>圣佑术</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:69%">10.6 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">建议：圣盾 1 次交光束</span><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">其余几轮光束交圣佑</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s7">下一段：前厅 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 前厅 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s7">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>前厅 → 化身</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 宝珠守望者 / 神庙干扰者 / 无信援兵</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>蚀骨践踏交圣佑。圣盾转好了才考虑交：前厅交了，3.5 分钟后才转好，化身那次就只能留给第二次腐化（约开打后 2 分半）；赶不上就别交。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1303486}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">蚀骨践踏</div><div class="s">宝珠守望者读条 · 60 码自然 + 10 秒持续</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条时开，罩住首击和前几跳（持续 10 秒比圣佑长 2 秒）；站远躲不掉，60 码覆盖全场。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1303486}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">蚀骨践踏</div><div class="s">圣佑在冷却</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span></div>
            <div class="why">备选：开圣盾免掉首击和持续。前提同上：要赶得上化身的第二次腐化。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">建议：圣佑交践踏</span><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾 0–1 次（要赶得上第二次腐化）</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s8">下一段：化身 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 4 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s8">
      <div class="node">4</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>塞塔里斯的化身</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 4</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>这场要把化身治满。精华污染者的污染之秽会让化身吃不到外部治疗，圣疗要避开它交。腐化来自场上的腐蚀生命力：分工去碰，碰到的人上一层腐化；没人碰会炸开。第一次约开打后 40 秒，第二次约 2 分半；圣盾交其中一次（前厅用过就交第二次），其余交圣佑。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:633}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>化身需要治疗</div><div class="s">塞塔里斯的化身 · 友方目标</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:633}}" alt="">圣疗术</span><span class="tgt">给化身</span></div>
            <div class="why">按你的最大生命值整管治疗，直接推进战斗。<b>先确认化身身上没有污染之秽</b>，有就等它结束；自己挂着腐化时治疗量会少三成。治疗之手按目标缺血量缩短冷却，转好且化身能吃治疗就补第二次。自律挂在化身身上，你的圣盾和保护不受影响。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300877}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>腐化</div><div class="s">碰腐蚀生命力上身 · 15 秒暗影持续 · 可叠层 · 造成的治疗 −33%</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span><span class="or">或</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">上身后血线往下掉就开圣盾，8 秒内跳伤全免（减益清不掉，圣盾结束后还会再跳几下）；牺牲祝福正好转好可以趁圣盾给队友。圣盾在冷却的那几次交圣佑。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1302618}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">邪恶冲锋</div><div class="s">堕落的守护者冲向玩家 · 暗影 + 8 秒持续</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">保护祝福挡不住，交给治疗</span></div>
            <div class="why">暗影伤害，保护只免疫物理；圣佑优先留给腐化。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1311979}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">潜藏妖术</div><div class="s">扭曲的妖术师 · 4 秒暗影，结束时 10 码爆炸</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">离挂着妖术的人 10 码</span></div>
            <div class="why">爆炸后留下妖术淤泥，踩进去变青蛙不能输出。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">腐化每跳吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">25.6 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>圣佑术</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:72%">18.4 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>圣盾术</span><div class="bar"><span class="zero">0 · 免疫</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:633}}" alt="">建议：圣疗给化身 1 次（转好再补）</span><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾 1 次交腐化</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#talent">查看天赋 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="talent">
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">取自 +23 限时录像的惩戒天赋，英雄天赋烈日先驱。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-label">这几个防御/功能天赋不要动</p>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:146956}}" alt=""><div><b>圣光决断</b><span>自律期间仍能开圣盾，保护清流血后照样有圣盾救急。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:114154}}" alt=""><div><b>不败之魂</b><span>圣盾、圣佑、圣疗冷却缩短三成，圣盾 3.5 分钟正好排下光束和腐化。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:469321}}" alt=""><div><b>正义保护</b><span>牺牲祝福移除并挡住中毒，毒蛇道的细胞毒素多一种清法。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:326734}}" alt=""><div><b>治疗之手</b><span>目标缺血越多圣疗冷却越短，给化身的圣疗转得更快。</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-note">常见可换：<b>圣光的正义</b>换迅捷审判，或<b>正义保护、正义牺牲</b>换圣洁之地、带头冲锋（换后牺牲祝福变回 2 分钟且不再清毒）。</p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>惩戒骑 · 塞塔里斯神庙 应对手册 · 2026-11</div>
    <div class="refs">参考录像：
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/14mrYRDaCVQ378Pj#fight=12">Âra +23 29:51</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/QHy4YJPF6V8GARav#fight=9">哦毕爷 +23 30:36</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/PFnYKkZxRgDVhqW1#fight=14">没点东西丷 +23 30:40</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/KP7k1TCHX6WcaZMv#fight=12">Tracer +23 30:45</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/wqNRdB964Q2LzCcv#fight=449">Primarîus +23 30:51</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
(function(){
  var btn=document.getElementById("copy-btn"), code=document.getElementById("talent-code");
  if(btn&&code){
    btn.addEventListener("click",function(){
      var t=code.textContent.trim();
      function done(){btn.textContent="已复制";setTimeout(function(){btn.textContent="复制";},1600);}
      function fallback(){var r=document.createRange();r.selectNodeContents(code);var sel=window.getSelection();sel.removeAllRanges();sel.addRange(r);try{document.execCommand("copy");done();}catch(e){btn.textContent="已选中，按 Ctrl+C";}}
      if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(done,fallback);}else{fallback();}
    });
  }

  var links={};
  document.querySelectorAll(".nav a[href^='#']").forEach(function(a){links[a.getAttribute("href").slice(1)]=a;});
  var targets=Object.keys(links).map(function(id){return document.getElementById(id);}).filter(Boolean);
  function spy(){
    var y=window.scrollY+110, cur=targets[0]?targets[0].id:null;
    targets.forEach(function(el){if(el.getBoundingClientRect().top+window.scrollY<=y) cur=el.id;});
    if(targets.length&&window.innerHeight+window.scrollY>=document.documentElement.scrollHeight-4) cur=targets[targets.length-1].id;
    Object.keys(links).forEach(function(id){links[id].classList.toggle("on",id===cur);});
  }
  window.addEventListener("scroll",spy,{passive:true}); spy();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
